  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop onion and garlic. Roughly chop herbs. Grate the carrot.\n• Drain the sweetcorn.\n• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn kernels until lightly browned, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a medium bowl. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the corn kernels are \"popping\" out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/622822c255a06a4826062d9a/step-bd594911.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook onion and carrot, stirring, until tender, 3-4 minutes.\n• SPICY! The spice blend and chipotle sauce are mild, but use less if you're sensitive to heat. Add garlic, Tex-Mex spice blend and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Add black beans (including the liquid!) and mild chipotle sauce. Cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat. Lightly mash with a fork or potato masher. TIP: The black bean liquid helps season and thicken the beans!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/622822c255a06a4826062d9a/step-1a2db6c8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While beans are cooking, combine corn, shredded cabbage mix and coriander. Add garlic aioli and a drizzle of white wine vinegar. Season with salt, then toss to coat.\n• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate in 10 second bursts, until warmed",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/622822c255a06a4826062d9a/step-fbea17c5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop pickled jalapeños (if using).\n• Fill each tortilla with a helping of chipotle black beans and herby corn slaw.\n• Sprinkle with jalapeños to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/622822c255a06a4826062d9a/step-9d79eb41.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
